              "heading": "ZX Bank Ltd. – Sri Lanka Branch Network"
            },
            "text": "ZX Bank Ltd. has established a robust presence in Sri Lanka with a strategically distributed network of 32 branches spanning all major provinces. This extensive coverage ensures that customers across Sri Lanka have convenient access to a wide range of banking services, from retail and SME banking to remittances and digital solutions. Each branch is equipped to support both individuals and businesses, furthering financial inclusion nation-wide."
